      "cooked": "<p>Im new to erpnext and maybe I oversaw some settings but, if I create a new customer or supplier the naming_series will not count or anything. I recognized the problem when I wanted to print de customer.</p>\n<p>I have the default settings changed nothing but the naming_series want change.</p>\n<p>I made a custom erpnext installation, same problem with the quick setup in docker and in trail version on erpnext homepage. Version-15 and Version-16 (Trail Version)</p>\n<p>What do I wrong?/Which steps did I miss?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/d/5d71e33c3d9d5e24afa4f9a074fa7f321cb61c05.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5d71e33c3d9d5e24afa4f9a074fa7f321cb61c05\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/d/5d71e33c3d9d5e24afa4f9a074fa7f321cb61c05.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dkEphVMBXL3rpbX4Uy1Na8DgGmp\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" data-dominant-color=\"F4F4F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">643×642 14.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d744a97ccc31d88a698033d8d37bfab5d269e948_2_690x56.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uIlLmyyNJiq7YBrTJMVdmfNYZFm\" width=\"690\" height=\"56\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d744a97ccc31d88a698033d8d37bfab5d269e948_2_690x56.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d744a97ccc31d88a698033d8d37bfab5d269e948_2_1035x84.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/7/d744a97ccc31d88a698033d8d37bfab5d269e948.png 2x\"