      "id": 492360,
      "username": "rishabgupta",
      "name": "Rishab Gupta",
      "created_at": "2026-01-24T03:13:25.512Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The naming series field on Customer/Supplier is ignored by default. You need to change how ERPNext names these documents.</p>\n<p>For Customers: Selling Settings → Customer Naming By → change from “Customer Name” to “Naming Series”</p>\n<p>For Suppliers: Buying Settings → Supplier Naming By → change from “Supplier Name” to “Naming Series”</p>\n<p>After that, your CUST-.##### or SUPP-.##### series will work as expected.</p>",
